&lt;p&gt;Everything below the fold on the homepage is new: a live X feed that pulls my latest posts with no API key and no paid tier, my photo up top, the whole thing rebuilt and deployed from chat while I was on my phone. I just approved each step and watched it ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Honestly impressed. More experiments to come — this space is where I&amp;rsquo;ll write about them.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FV8: A Forced Execution JavaScript Engine for Detecting Evasive Techniques</title><link>https://pantelaios.com/publications/fvvvvvvvv8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 May 2024 23:49:01 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://pantelaios.com/publications/fvvvvvvvv8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Nikolaos Pantelaios&lt;/strong&gt;, and Alexandros Kapravelos. 2024. &lt;em&gt;FV8: A Forced Execution JavaScript Engine for Detecting Evasive Techniques. In proceedings of the Usenix Security Symposium, 2024&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
