&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Nikolaos (Nikos) Pantelaios. I&amp;rsquo;m an AI Research Scientist at Meta, working on post-training for Muse and the Muse Spark model family — RL and post-training for frontier models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before Meta, I did my PhD in Computer Science at NC State University (2018–2024), advised by Alexandros Kapravelos. My research was in web security: JavaScript engine analysis and fuzzing (FV8), malicious npm package detection, and evasion techniques.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Contact me - Nikolaos Pantelaios</title><link>https://pantelaios.com/contact/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pantelaios.com/contact/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
